WEBVTT

00:00:00.687 --> 00:00:01.586
<b>Part 2</b>

00:00:16.281 --> 00:00:20.715
We bought two coffees at the station café. We sat down.

00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:24.317
‘My name’s Olivia.’ She said.

00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:31.874
‘I’m David. I’m from Chicago. Nice to meet you. What do you do?’ I asked.

00:00:32.606 --> 00:00:38.430
I work in property – flats and houses. What do you do?

00:00:38.614 --> 00:00:40.149
I work for Citibank.

00:00:40.657 --> 00:00:43.319
‘That’s interesting!’ said Olivia.

00:00:44.025 --> 00:00:45.580
Do you live in London?

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:47.732
Yes, but I’m new here.

00:00:48.225 --> 00:00:52.523
I moved to London last month. I have a flat in Chelsea.

00:00:53.172 --> 00:00:56.780
Wow! That’s an expensive part of London!

00:00:57.697 --> 00:00:59.030
I looked at my watch.

00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:03.111
‘Time to go. I have a tennis lesson this evening.’

00:01:04.023 --> 00:01:06.908
‘I can drive you home… ‘ she said.

00:01:07.392 --> 00:01:09.062
I live near Chelsea.

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:11.955
I told her my address.